        "startMs": 3401,
        "confidence": 0.49924999999999997
      },
      {
        "id": "phrase-9",
        "text": "从篷隙向外一望，",
        "endMs": 4161,
        "startMs": 3501,
        "confidence": 0.12528571428571428
      },
      {
        "id": "phrase-10",
        "text": "苍黄的天底下，",
        "endMs": 4441,
        "startMs": 4221,
        "confidence": 0.26216666666666666
      },
      {
        "id": "phrase-11",
        "text": "远近横着几个萧索的荒村，",
        "endMs": 5261,
        "startMs": 4581,
        "confidence": 0.32618181818181813
      },
      {
        "id": "phrase-12",
        "text": "没有一些活气。",
        "endMs": 5882,
        "startMs": 5301,
        "confidence": 0.4486666666666667
      },
      {
        "id": "phrase-13",
        "text": "我的心禁不住悲凉起来了。",
        "endMs": 6422,
        "startMs": 5982,
        "confidence": 0.1970909090909091
      },
      {
        "id": "phrase-14",
        "text": "啊！",
        "endMs": 6462,
        "startMs": 6442,
        "confidence": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "phrase-15",
        "text": "这不是我二十年来时时记得的故乡？",
        "endMs": 6782,
        "startMs": 6482,
        "confidence": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "phrase-16",
        "text": "我所记得的故乡全不如此。",
        "endMs": 7022,
        "startMs": 6802,
        "confidence": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "phrase-17",
        "text": "我的故乡好得多了。",
        "endMs": 7842,
        "startMs": 7482,
        "confidence": 0.23049999999999998
      },
      {
        "id": "phrase-18",
        "text": "但要我记起它的美丽，",
